<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Lai Sun Garment, Lai Sun Dev suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Lai Sun Garment, Lai Sun Dev suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Lai Sun Garment (International) Ltd and Lai Sun Development Co Ltd was suspended on Wednesday at the companies' request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said.  </p>
<p>On Tuesday, shares of Lai Sun Development rose HK$0.15 to HK$12.65, while Lai Sun Garment shares ended HK$0.05 down at HK$11.75.</p>
<p>Lai Sun Garment, which manufactures and exports garments, controls Lai Sun Development.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
